  154                 /       /M                      MULTIPLE PAPER-TAPE MODE IS ENABLED.  AT THE END OF
  155                 /                               THE LATEST PAPER-TAPE, THE USER INDICATES IF FURTHER
  156                 /                               PAPER-TAPE DATA IS AVAILABLE; CONSOLE INPUT IS
  157                 /                               REQUIRED [PRESS CONTROL-Z TO CANCEL, ANY OTHER KEY TO
  158                 /                               PROCEED] TO CONTINUE.  [NOTE: AT THE END OF ANY
  159                 /                               PAPER-TAPE, THE LATEST LINE OF TEXT WITHIN THE CURRENT
  160                 /                               OUTPUT FILE IS TERMINATED WITH AN INTERNAL END-OF-LINE
  161                 /                               SEQUENCE [IF NECESSARY]; HOWEVER, IN MULTIPLE
  162                 /                               PAPER-TAPE MODE, THE CURRENT OUTPUT FILE REMAINS OPEN
  163                 /                               TO ALLOW FURTHER PAPER-TAPE INPUT TO BE APPENDED TO
  164                 /                               THE CURRENT OUTPUT FILE.  ONCE MULTIPLE PAPER-TAPE
  165                 /                               MODE CONCLUDES, THE CURRENT OUTPUT FILE WILL BE CLOSED
  166                 /                               IN THE SAME MANNER AS WHEN MULTIPLE PAPER-TAPE MODE IS
  167                 /                               NOT IN EFFECT.]
  168   
